  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Eternal_Wand_of_Magic_Missile\">Eternal Wand of Magic Missile</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/edit/Template:Eternal_wand?section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Eternal Wand of Magic Missile\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"border-color-1\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #DDF solid; margin: 4px; width: 95%; --bg-color-1:#DDDDFF;--bg-color-1-dark:#626474;--bg-color-2:#EEEEFF;--bg-color-2-dark:#515366;--border-color-1:#DDDDFF;--border-color-1-dark:#626474;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\" width=\"20%\"><a href=\"/page/UMD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"UMD\">UMD</a> Difficulty\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\" width=\"50%\">20\n</td>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\" width=\"30%\" rowspan=\"10\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Spell_magicmissile.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Spell_magicmissile.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span> <br /><a href=\"/page/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\">Magic Missile</a><br />\n<p>Caster Level: 3<br />\n50/50 Charges<br />\nRecharged/Day: 50\n</p>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">No <a href=\"/page/UMD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"UMD\">UMD</a> check for:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">Wiz, Sor\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Minimum Level:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a>, <a href=\"/page/Exclusive\" title=\"Exclusive\">Exclusive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Durability:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Material:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a>:</b> <b>Wood</b> is common for use in <a href=\"/page/Quarterstaff\" title=\"Quarterstaff\">Quarterstaffs</a>, <a href=\"/page/Bow\" title=\"Bow\">bows</a>, or <a href=\"/page/Ammo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ammo\">ammo</a>. It is light, but its durability is low.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Hardness:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Weight:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Base Value:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">500 pp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Location:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Endgame:_Marguerite\" title=\"Endgame: Marguerite\">Endgame: Marguerite</a></b>, end chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\">Magic Missile</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\">Magic Missile</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 3<br /><b>Charges: </b>50 (50/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 50 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:50)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +20</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +20</a>:</b> Passive: +20 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to each <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Eternal_Wand_of_Magic_Missile.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Eternal_Wand_of_Magic_Missile.png/420px-Eternal_Wand_of_Magic_Missile.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"483\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Eternal_Wand_of_Magic_Missile.png 1.5x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<p>Not upgradeable \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><i>A thin rod of blackened wood containing charges of the Magic Missile spell. Eternal wands recharge over time if they are not actively being used.<br /></i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">Even though it says it recharges every day, the wand actually recovers 1 charge every 4 seconds making this wand have effectively infinite charges.<br />\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Eternal_Wand_of_Magic_Missile_shown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Eternal_Wand_of_Magic_Missile_shown.jpg/350px-Eternal_Wand_of_Magic_Missile_shown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"350\" height=\"286\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Eternal_Wand_of_Magic_Missile_shown.jpg 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817043334\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1908/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13982/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3665/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   34.914      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   34.914      1 -total\n 94.93%   33.143      1 Template:Eternal_wand\n 53.63%   18.724      3 Template:Popup\n 50.11%   17.495    